  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Roof Tile Comp -97 (WoL)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Takpannan -97 (A-l&#xe5;n)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 1997 Sida gave a write-off loan (500 000 SEK) to &apos;Takpannan AB&apos; for training of DRINA Company aiming to develop production of roof tiles in Gorazde, Bosnia-Herzegovina (219/97). The project is now completed and the total amount has been disbursed. The loan will now be written -off.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida utvecklade 1997 ett avskrivningsl&#xe5;n till Takpannan AB f&#xf6;r utbildning av f&#xf6;retaget DRINA Company f&#xf6;r utveckling av tillverkning av taktegel i Gorazde, Bosnien-Herzegovina (&#xd6;ST-219/97). Insatsen &#xe4;r nu avslutad och l&#xe5;net skrivs av.</narrative>
  </description>
